description: Git commits and PRs must not carry Cursor co-author or marketing footers
alwaysApply: true
---

# Git and PR attribution

- Commit with `C:\Program Files\Git\cmd\git.exe` only. Use `-m` messages with **no** `Co-authored-by` trailers (especially not Cursor / cursoragent).
- Do **not** append "Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)" to PR titles, bodies, or commit messages.
- When creating PRs with `gh pr create`, keep the body free of tool attribution; strip any auto-appended Cursor footer before pushing.
- Prefer squash-merge commit messages that are a single title line only (no co-author lines).
